<title>JAPAN: Cosmo Oil plans lower capital spending in 1997/98.</title>
<headline>Cosmo Oil plans lower capital spending in 1997/98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosmo Oil Co Ltd said on Tuesday that it plans capital investment of 32 billion yen for the current fiscal year, which began on April 1, down from 50 billion yen in fiscal 1996/97.  </p>
<p>The major Japanese oil refiner and wholesaler earlier on Tuesday reported parent current profits of 11.13 billion yen in fiscal 1996/97, down 6.5 percent from the previous year.</p>
